Meanwhile scene oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-11-09. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
Lets the meanwhile scene probes play a palace scene frame by frame through its box, fades and loads: the tail of
MainGameScreenHandle (the fade-in's start and the leave of the tactical screen) moves into HandleTacticalLeaveScreen,
called where the code was; DoMessageBox hands the box's flags to the probe in gOracleMessageBoxFlags before the 0027
hook, so the probe tells an OK box from an OK and Skip one; appended accessors read the file statics of Meanwhile.cc
(the scene's camera tile, the sector, selected sector, screen and world flag the way back reloads, the NPC save slots).
No behaviour change. Applied by tools/oracle/build.sh after 0031.
